@methods: housing_choice
# The methods of the owner's housing-choice stage as an addition to
# applications/housing-owner/declaration/stages/housing_choice/housing_choice.bl,
# rewritten from stages/housing_choice/methods.yml and the block file
# methods/marginals_housing_choice.bl: the derivative of the decision value in
# cash on hand, appended to the decision value builder, and the derivative of
# the arrival value in assets, with the factor R of the law w = R*b + z_vals[y],
# appended to the arrival value builder. The YAML binds no method, so the file
# writes no method entry, no grid and no setting.
# The two blocks of the block file, there named dcsn_marginal and arvl_marginal,
# are named here by the builders' ids and keep the block file's partial
# signatures, which name coordinates the stage already declares and add none:
# the union of rule 4 merges each coordinate with the stage's by its name and
# keeps the stage's typing (F16).
# The stage file is refused by the elaborator today at the selection
# z_vals[y] of the line cash_on_hand, rule family-selection, and would next be
# refused at XH := linspace(H_min, H_max, n_H), rule not-constructed
# (sheet §4.5).

[id=cntn_to_dcsn, (V[>]) : !cntn -> (V) : !dcsn] {
    D_{w}V = D_{w_c}V[>]            :: [id=marginal]
}

[id=dcsn_to_arvl, (V) : !dcsn -> (V[<]) : !arvl] {
    D_{b}V[<] = E_{y}(R*D_{w}V)     :: [id=marginal]
}
